# Phase 3: push/pop slide transitions (~200 ms, ease-out; only the body
# below the header moves, the header title just switches).
# docs/phase3-brief.md, agent A "Slide transitions".
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p3-transition.script
#
# The *_mid shots are taken ~50-100 ms into a slide (the key is held 50 ms)
# and depend on timing: kept out of the goldens.
# golden: skip push_mid pop_mid push2_mid pop2_mid
#
# Trace: with animated push/pop there are fewer "update full" lines (only
# boot); the upper bound stays 1 + SELECT/MENU presses.

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
shot boot

# split screen (Music) push and pop
key SELECT 50       # push Music: slides in from the right
shot push_mid
wait 600
shot push_done

key MENU 50         # pop: slides back to the left
shot pop_mid
wait 600
shot pop_done       # main menu, "Music" still selected

# full-width list (Settings, 4th main-menu row) push and pop
wheel +3
wait 400
key SELECT 50
shot push2_mid
wait 600
shot push2_done

key MENU 50
shot pop2_mid
wait 600
shot pop2_done

quit
